Warning [jet.UnmountedHttpRoutes]: HTTP route method `joke` belongs to a struct that is never mounted.
  --> http_route_unmounted.jet:4:5
    |
  4 |     #Server.Get("/jokes/:id")
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Route markers record facts; only an explicit app.mount(value) exposes that struct's routes.
 Fix: Pass a value of `Dormant` to app.mount, or remove the route marker.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2818
